  "answer": "Project Zenith is a multi-phase initiative focused on data analytics, cloud storage optimization, and security. Key updates include: \n\n1. **Launch & Leadership**: Initially introduced with Sarah Tan as lead (kickoff June 15, $500k budget), later associated with Marcus Cole (Q3 2023, July 15 kickoff) and Omar Jensen (development phase lead). \n2. **Team Expansion**: The team has grown with five new members specializing in cybersecurity and cloud architecture, plus Mike Chen (machine learning) and Lisa Ray (cloud computing). Onboarding occurred on September 10. \n3. **Budgets**: Phase one had a $500,000 allocation. Compliance plan budget increased to $55,000. Training program budget approved at $15,000. \n4. **Security & Compliance**: Security protocols updated (MFA, encryption) effective January next year. \n5. **Partnerships**: Exploring collaboration with TechInnovate for AI technology. \n6. **Phases**: Moved from design to development phase."
